    {
      "id": "claim_9551b9028b8b4b62929faa5c562b550e",
      "statement": "The stream method yields partial outputs; default implementation calls invoke once and yields the result. Specialized components (LLMs, parsers) override to yield tokens or partial results progressively. Transform method by default buffers input and calls stream.",
