    {
      "id": "claim_73dec1bb64ad4bb8a76fd790178f3a5c",
      "statement": "Runnables support declarative composition via the pipe operator (|) which chains runnables sequentially and accepts Runnable instances, callables (auto-wrapped in RunnableLambda), and dict literals (auto-wrapped in RunnableParallel). Composition automatically inherits full sync, async, batch, and streaming support.",
