      "id": "claim_824e229b3d6143478a5ac469610e427a",
      "statement": "Runnables expose schema information via input_schema, output_schema, InputType, OutputType, and config_schema properties and methods. These return Pydantic models or type annotations that enable validation, documentation generation, tool interfaces, and dynamic schema adaptation based on runtime config.",
