      "id": "claim_da26e4c1091c400480447ba780a71507",
      "statement": "The astream_events method streams structured lifecycle events (on_start, on_stream, on_end) from the runnable and child runnables. Events are dictionaries with event name, run_id, parent_ids, tags, metadata, and data keys. Filtering by include/exclude names, types, and tags enables selective event capture. Version v2 (recommended) includes parent_ids and custom events; v1/v3 have different schemas.",
